                                        "glosses": [
                                            "former kingdom and geographical area in Central Europe, now divided between Poland and Ukraine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b5834b6-b541-4bf7-ac25-351864fb3b18",
                                                "sense_id": "09180bc6-c4f6-3dc0-8985-e57763254d9c",
                                                "text": "The czar had declared the \"liberation\" of the Ukrainian minorities inhabiting the eastern portion of the Austrian imperial province of Galicia, the Austrian portion of partitioned Poland, to be one of Russia's objectives."
